  "contentHtml": "<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이준용 선생님께)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">안녕하세요.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">가족 모두 건강하게 잘 지내시구요?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이제 미국 생활하신지 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">년 되셨네요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">그리고 이제 1년 남으셨네요.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">저에게 미국생활 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">년은 인생에서 매우 소중한 시간이었습니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">잘한 점도 있지만 아쉬운 점도 많습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">다시 그 때로 돌아갈 수 있다면...</span></p></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">이준용 선생님께서도 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">지난 1년을 점검하시고, 남은 1년을 새롭게 계획하시면&nbsp;좋겠다는 생각으로 글을 씁니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">1. 미국유학을 떠나시면서 선생님께서 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">년간 이루고자 하셨던 꿈들은 무엇인가요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">2. 지난 1년간 그 꿈 중에서 어떤 것들을 이루셨나요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">3. 남은 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">년 동안 꼭 하시고 싶은 일들은 무엇인가요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; Bucket List를 만들어보시면 어떨까요?</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">저도 같이 고민하겠습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">남은 1년,</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">많이 행복하세요.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">부럽습니다~~~</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
